       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INVOICE-DISCOUNT.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-ITEM-QUANTITY         PIC 9(3) VALUE 4.
01 WS-UNIT-PRICE            PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 25.00.
01 WS-SUBTOTAL              PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-DISCOUNT-RATE         PIC 99 VALUE 15.
01 WS-DISCOUNT              PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-TOTAL-DUE             PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-DISPLAY-AMOUNT        PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    COMPUTE WS-SUBTOTAL = WS-ITEM-QUANTITY * WS-UNIT-PRICE
    PERFORM CALCULATE-DISCOUNT
    COMPUTE WS-TOTAL-DUE = WS-SUBTOTAL - WS-DISCOUNT

    DISPLAY "INVOICE DISCOUNT SAMPLE"
    MOVE WS-SUBTOTAL TO WS-DISPLAY-AMOUNT
    DISPLAY "Subtotal: " WS-DISPLAY-AMOUNT
    MOVE WS-DISCOUNT TO WS-DISPLAY-AMOUNT
    DISPLAY "Discount (" WS-DISCOUNT-RATE "%): " WS-DISPLAY-AMOUNT
    MOVE WS-TOTAL-DUE TO WS-DISPLAY-AMOUNT
    DISPLAY "Total due: " WS-DISPLAY-AMOUNT
    STOP RUN.

CALCULATE-DISCOUNT.
    *> Intentional sample bug: this hard-codes 5% instead of using
    *> WS-DISCOUNT-RATE, which is set to 15.
    COMPUTE WS-DISCOUNT ROUNDED = WS-SUBTOTAL * 0.05.
